  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your mount is the embodiment of Law.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Divine bond class feature with the mount option, paladin level 13th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your mount gains the benefits of the resolute simple template (Pathfinder Roleplaying Game Bestiary 2) in addition to the celestial template.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> Paladin and Justicar levels stack for qualifying for this feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alternate-justicar#toc30\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
